## Things I've learnt

This is how you pad integers when printing to standard output. Look into `<iomanip>` header to learn more about standard output formatting.

```c++
#include <iomanip>

int main() {
    std::cout << std::setfill(' ') << std::setw(3) << 25;
    return 0;
}
```
